MultiprojectiveVarieties -- Multi-projective varieties and multi-rational maps
******************************************************************************

Description
===========

This is a package for handling multi-projective varieties, that is, closed
subvarieties of products of projective spaces, and rational maps between them.
This extends the package *note Cremona: (Cremona)Top,, which treats *note
rational maps: (Cremona)RationalMap, from multi-projective varieties to
standard projective varieties, $X\subseteq
\mathbb{P}^{k_1}\times\mathbb{P}^{k_2}\times\cdots\times\mathbb{P}^{k_n}\
dashrightarrow Y\subseteq\mathbb{P}^N$.

References
==========

ArXiv preprint: Computations with rational maps between multi-projective
varieties (see https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.04503 ).
* Menu:

* MultiprojectiveVariety::      the class of all multi-projective varieties
* MultirationalMap::            the class of all multi-rational maps

