MultiprojectiveVariety -- the class of all multi-projective varieties
*********************************************************************

Description
===========

A multi-projective variety is a closed subvariety of a product of projective
spaces $\mathbb{P}^{k_1}\times\mathbb{P}^{k_2}\times\cdots\times\mathbb{P}^{k_n
}$. This is actually the class of all closed subschemes of products of
projective spaces.

* Menu:

* projectiveVariety::           the closed multi-projective subvariety defined by a multi-homogeneous ideal
* projectiveVariety(List,Ring): projectiveVariety_lpList_cmRing_rp.  product of projective spaces
* projectiveVariety(List,List,Ring): projectiveVariety_lpList_cmList_cmRing_rp.  the Segre-Veronese variety
* projectiveVariety(MultidimensionalMatrix): projectiveVariety_lpMultidimensionalMatrix_rp.  the multi-projective variety defined by a multi-dimensional matrix

Types of multi-projective variety:
==================================

  * *note EmbeddedProjectiveVariety: EmbeddedProjectiveVariety, -- the class of
    all embedded projective varieties
  * *note WeightedProjectiveVariety: WeightedProjectiveVariety, -- the class of
    all weighted projective varieties

Functions and methods returning a multi-projective variety:
===========================================================

  * *note ambientVariety: ambientVariety, -- the ambient variety of a
    projective subvariety
  * *note baseLocus: baseLocus, -- the base locus of a multi-rational map
  * *note fiberProduct: fiberProduct, -- fiber product of multi-projective
    varieties
  * *note projectiveVariety: projectiveVariety, -- the closed multi-projective
    subvariety defined by a multi-homogeneous ideal

