coneOfLines -- cone of lines on a subvariety passing through a point
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        coneOfLines(X,p)
        coneOfLines(p,X)
  * Inputs:
      * X, an *note embedded projective variety: EmbeddedProjectiveVariety,, a
        subvariety of $\mathbb{P}^n$
      * p, an *note embedded projective variety: EmbeddedProjectiveVariety,, a
        point on $X$
  * Outputs:
      * an *note embedded projective variety: EmbeddedProjectiveVariety,, the
        subscheme of $\mathbb{P}^n$ consisting of the union of all lines
        contained in $X$ and passing through $p$

Description
===========

In the example below we compute the cone of lines passing through the generic
point of a smooth del Pezzo fourfold in $\mathbb{P}^7$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : K := frac(QQ[a,b,c,d,e]); t = gens ring PP_K^4; phi = rationalMap       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : MultirationalMap (rational map from PP^4 to PP^7)                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{minors(2,matrix{{t_0,t_1,t_2},{t_1,t_2,t_3}}) + t_4};                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : X = image phi;                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ProjectiveVariety, 4-dimensional subvariety of PP^7                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : ideal X                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|             2                                     2                         |
|o5 = ideal (y  - y y  + y y , y y  - y y  + y y , y  - y y  + y y , y y  -   |
|             5    4 6    2 7   4 5    3 6    1 7   4    3 5    0 7   2 4     |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     y y  + y y , y y  - y y  + y y )                                        |
|      1 5    0 6   2 3    1 4    0 5                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Ideal of frac(QQ[a..e])[y ..y ]                                         |
|                              0   7                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : p := projectiveVariety minors(2,(vars K)||(vars ring PP_K^4))           |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = point of coordinates [a/e, b/e, c/e, d/e, 1]                            |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : ProjectiveVariety, a point in PP^4                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : coneOfLines(X,phi p)                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = surface in PP^7 cut out by 6 hypersurfaces of degrees 1^3 2^3           |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : ProjectiveVariety, surface in PP^7                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : ideal oo                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|                                          2                                  |
|                 d      2c      b      - c  + b*d          d      c      b   |
|o8 = ideal (y  - -*y  + --*y  - -*y  + ----------*y , y  - -*y  + -*y  + -*y |
|             2   e  4    e  5   e  6        2      7   1   e  3   e  4   e  5|
|                                           e                                 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                            2                |
|       a      - b*c + a*d          c      2b      a      - b  + a*c      2   |
|     - -*y  + -----------*y , y  - -*y  + --*y  - -*y  + ----------*y , y  - |
|       e  6         2      7   0   e  3    e  4   e  5        2      7   5   |
|                   e                                         e               |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                         2                                   |
|            d        2c        b        c  - b*d  2                d         |
|     y y  + -*y y  - --*y y  + -*y y  + --------*y , y y  - y y  + -*y y  -  |
|      4 6   e  4 7    e  5 7   e  6 7       2     7   4 5    3 6   e  3 7    |
|                                           e                                 |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                                                             |
|     c        b        a        b*c - a*d  2   2          c        2b        |
|     -*y y  - -*y y  + -*y y  + ---------*y , y  - y y  + -*y y  - --*y y  + |
|     e  4 7   e  5 7   e  6 7        2     7   4    3 5   e  3 7    e  4 7   |
|                                    e                                        |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|               2                                                             |
|     a        b  - a*c  2                                                    |
|     -*y y  + --------*y )                                                   |
|     e  5 7       2     7                                                    |
|                 e                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : Ideal of frac(QQ[a..e])[y ..y ]                                         |
|                              0   7                                          |
