hilbertPolynomial(EmbeddedProjectiveVariety) -- the Hilbert polynomial of the variety
*************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note hilbertPolynomial: (Macaulay2Doc)hilbertPolynomial,
  * Usage: 
        hilbertPolynomial X
  * Inputs:
      * X, an *note embedded projective variety: EmbeddedProjectiveVariety,
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Projective: (Macaulay2Doc)hilbertPolynomial_lp_pd_pd_pd_
        cmProjective=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, => ..., default value true,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note projective Hilbert polynomial:
        (Macaulay2Doc)ProjectiveHilbertPolynomial,, the Hilbert polynomial of X
        (calculated as *note hilbertPolynomial ideal:
        (Macaulay2Doc)hilbertPolynomial_lpIdeal_rp, X)

Description
===========

+-------------------------------------------+
|i1 : X = PP_QQ^(2,3);                      |
|                                           |
|o1 : ProjectiveVariety, surface in PP^9    |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i2 : hilbertPolynomial X                   |
|                                           |
|o2 = P  - 9*P  + 9*P                       |
|      0      1      2                      |
|                                           |
|o2 : ProjectiveHilbertPolynomial           |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i3 : hilbertPolynomial(X,Projective=>false)|
|                                           |
|     9 2   9                               |
|o3 = -i  + -i + 1                          |
|     2     2                               |
|                                           |
|o3 : QQ[i]                                 |
+-------------------------------------------+

