|     from curve in PP^1 x PP^1 defined by a multi-form of multi-degree (1,1)|
|     to any variety                                                         |
|                                                                            |
|o5 : Hom(X,*)                                                               |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : Hom(,Y)                                                                |
|                                                                            |
