image(MultirationalMap) -- image of a multi-rational map
********************************************************

  * Function: *note image: (Macaulay2Doc)image,
  * Usage: 
        image Phi
  * Inputs:
      * Phi, a *note multi-rational map: MultirationalMap,
  * Outputs:
