    a multi-rational map
  * *note MultirationalMap * MultirationalMap: MultirationalMap _st
    MultirationalMap, -- composition of multi-rational maps
  * *note MultirationalMap == MultirationalMap: MultirationalMap ==
    MultirationalMap, -- equality of multi-rational maps
  * *note degree(MultirationalMap): degree_lpMultirationalMap_rp, -- degree of
    a multi-rational map
  * *note image(MultirationalMap): image_lpMultirationalMap_rp, -- image of a
    multi-rational map
