schubertCycle -- take a random Schubert cycle
*********************************************

  * Usage: 
        schubertCycle(a,G)
  * Inputs:
      * a, a *note visible list: (Macaulay2Doc)VisibleList,, a list of integers
        $a = (a_0,\ldots,a_k)$ with $n-k\geq a_0 \geq \cdots \geq a_k \geq 0$
