trim(MultirationalMap) -- trim the target of a multi-rational map
*****************************************************************

  * Function: *note trim: (Macaulay2Doc)trim,
  * Usage: 
        trim Phi
  * Inputs:
      * Phi, a *note multi-rational map: MultirationalMap,, from a *note
        multi-projective variety: MultiprojectiveVariety, $X$ to
        $\mathbb{P}^{k_1}\times\cdots\times\mathbb{P}^{k_n}$
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Strategy: (Macaulay2Doc)Complement, => ..., default value null, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note multi-rational map: MultirationalMap,, from $X$ to
        $\mathbb{P}^{s_1}\times\cdots\times\mathbb{P}^{s_n}$, with $s_i\leq
        k_i$, which is isomorphic to the original map, but whose image is not
        contained in any hypersurface of multidegree $(d_1,\ldots,d_n)$ with
        $\sum_{i=1}^n d_i = 1$

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : K = ZZ/33331; C = PP_K^(1,4); -- rational normal quartic curve          |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : ProjectiveVariety, curve in PP^4                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : Phi = rationalMap C; -- map defined by the quadrics through C           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : MultirationalMap (rational map from PP^4 to PP^5)                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : Q = random(2,C); -- random quadric hypersurface through C               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : ProjectiveVariety, hypersurface in PP^4                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : Phi = Phi|Q;                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : MultirationalMap (rational map from Q to PP^5)                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : image Phi                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = threefold in PP^5 cut out by 2 hypersurfaces of degrees 1^1 2^1         |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : ProjectiveVariety, threefold in PP^5                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : Psi = trim Phi;                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : MultirationalMap (rational map from Q to PP^4)                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : image Psi                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = hypersurface in PP^4 defined by a form of degree 2                      |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : ProjectiveVariety, hypersurface in PP^4                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : Phi || Phi || Psi;                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : MultirationalMap (rational map from Q x Q x Q to PP^5 x PP^5 x PP^4)    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : image oo                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = 9-dimensional subvariety of PP^5 x PP^5 x PP^4                         |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : ProjectiveVariety, 9-dimensional subvariety of                         |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|cut out by 5 hypersurfaces of multi-degrees (0,0,2)^1 (0,1,0)^1 (0,2,0)^1    |
|                                                                             |
|PP^5 x PP^5 x PP^4                                                           |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|(1,0,0)^1 (2,0,0)^1                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : trim (Phi || Phi || Psi);                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : MultirationalMap (rational map from Q x Q x Q to PP^4 x PP^4 x PP^4)   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : image oo                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o12 = 9-dimensional subvariety of PP^4 x PP^4 x PP^4                         |
|                                                                             |
|o12 : ProjectiveVariety, 9-dimensional subvariety of                         |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|cut out by 3 hypersurfaces of multi-degrees (0,0,2)^1 (0,2,0)^1 (2,0,0)^1    |
|                                                                             |
|PP^4 x PP^4 x PP^4                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

